t may be absent; the framework must preserve that fact and any resulting unmet outcome or preparation refusal. Native actors may not create or infer it. The user can supply it between bounded Runs. Its arrival does not by itself prove the application outcome.\n\nA fresh Run may use explicitly admitted applicable prior Result evidence. Observe the current workspace and assess whether the selected producer's measured dependencies remain unchanged; preserve original Result/call/actor attribution and unresolved obligations. Do not rerun work merely to manufacture current authorship or provenance. An independent assessment uses actual current observations and admissible retained measurements. Prior Run status and judgments remain historical; they do not grant current closure. The normal current parent evaluation determines closure.\n\nThe allowed catalogue is not an expected graph schedule. Select justified work or report a truthful gap. Do not fabricate a pass, hide missing input or restore an old execution stack. No exact current_intent recovery is requested.\n"],"outcome":"Perform the selected uat work needed for the original task.","readFirst":["design/implementation-design.md","design/test-design.md","source/basic-cli.oracle.json","source/original-basic-cli.txt","source/witness-contract.md","specification/project-conformance.md","test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs","test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs","test-execution-plan.json","generated/hello-world.mjs","assessment/consumer-context.md"],"writeRoots":[]}}},"schemaVersion":"5.0.0","synthesis":{"basis":{"contextRef":"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/da01e6e0a00103a728d4b7f74614fe7d06e63f1219b6c98648aed11538e4852f","environmentDigest":"sha256:73731a287b82ef25fdf9ae3f3fd480dd547306e41dd6d58f1e469671fcd9cdef","environmentRef":"environment://default-library-witness/selected@5","frameEvidenceDigest":"sha256:c8d41dc0eaeec971b2427ac943959bb6d864088740c88f62ba6ed8a8cbc94c79","frameRefs":["stdo://releases/v2.5.1-rc.1/standards/STDO_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASELINE.md#derived-executive-frame"],"inputDigest":"sha256:8f6e487ddf522d1630fb7cddc20d8f4215c24633fce32ffe4ff584e2117b9598","inputRef":"result://abiogenesis/1d4bf0cf1d823a21f818fc28bdce46407ad6f2db6188600a10531b26b7710950","previousResultRef":"result://abiogenesis/5614fa7a5006466741aa3ae2aac161973fafe14298f0be53d42112241ad1c89b","taskRef":"task://default-library-witness/retained-supplied-work@5"},"judgment":{"contributions":[{"contribution":"Independently assess the whole original basic-cli outcome, read-only. Use the unchanged source/original-basic-cli.txt and the source/basic-cli.oracle.json rubric; the exact candidate generated/hello-world.mjs, confirming that its bytes match what was measured; and the supplied specification, implementation and test designs, component and UAT test bodies, and test-execution-plan.json, checking that their content is genuine rather than just present. Also use assessment/consumer-context.md as the user-supplied assessment input, and the current Testing measurement result b425dc00… as execution evidence. Check the oracle case (no arguments, stdout exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\", exit 0), confirm that both required tests execute the real CLI, check that there are at least 2 passes and 0 failures, check the plan's expectedStdoutMatch and assertedReturnValue, and check each required stage meaning, including test_execution_result: execution exited 0, the observed pass count is at least the expected count, and the plan is satisfied. Record every unmet or indeterminate criterion, and return the disposition verdict under the declared assessment contract. Do not edit any file, and do not certify from the measurement's success, file presence or stage count alone.","dependsOn":[],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/retained-supplied-work@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/da01e6e0a00103a728d4b7f74614fe7d06e63f1219b6c98648aed11538e4852f","result://abiogenesis/b425dc00b52424043757cd6dcfee11a0b48f6a1acf05bc1baa725567d85fe7ac","result://abiogenesis/5614fa7a5006466741aa3ae2aac161973fafe14298f0be53d42112241ad1c89b"],"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","reason":"Only an independent assessment against the rubric can settle complete-source-outcome. Its inputs are now all available: result b425dc00… is a current native-work Testing measurement, assessment/consumer-context.md is observed present, and all protected sources and the candidate are present. The completed Testing result is cited as evidence, not as a dependency, because it is prior finished work and is not rerun.","supportRefs":["support://default-library-witness/complete-source-outcome@5"]}],"gaps":[],"interpretation":"This Run continues from the prior judgment (result 5614fa7a…). That judgment selected Testing and recorded two blockers for UAT: there was no current execution measurement, and assessment/consumer-context.md was absent. Both blockers are now resolved. First, Testing has completed as result b425dc00…. Command 0 (`node generated/hello-world.mjs`) exited 0 with no signal or timeout, and wrote exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" (14 bytes) to stdout with empty stderr. Command 1 (`node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`) exited 0 and reported 2 tests, 2 passes and 0 failures, including the plan's expectedStdoutMatch fragment \"fail 0\". Stderr was empty. Second, the current worksite observation (da01e6e0…) shows assessment/consumer-context.md as a present 600-byte file. It is a user-supplied assessment input, not proof of the outcome. The candidate generated/hello-world.mjs is still present (30 bytes, sha256:fe8f4080…), and nothing indicates it changed after the measurement. Its body is not shown to this frame. The supplied component and UAT tests both spawn process.execPath with generated/hello-world.mjs and assert status 0 and exact stdout, which matches the oracle case and the original task. The execution plan matches the required command, args, pass floor and stdout match. None of this is a verdict. Command success and passing tests establish only the exercised behavior. The complete-source-outcome support stays unresolved until an independent assessment reviews the exact candidate, the original source, the oracle rubric, the supplied artifacts, the consumer context and this current measurement. The Testing result is reused as admitted evidence and is not rerun.","nextEvidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/retained-supplied-work@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/da01e6e0a00103a728d4b7f74614fe7d06e63f1219b6c98648aed11538e4852f","result://abiogenesis/b425dc00b52424043757cd6dcfee11a0b48f6a1acf05bc1baa725567d85fe7ac"],"nextGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","nextReason":"UAT is the one remaining capability that can decide the unresolved complete-source-outcome support, and nothing blocks it now. Its subject is the exact current Testing measurement result b425dc00…, which recorded both declared commands with exit 0, the exact direct stdout, and a test run with 2 passes and 0 failures. The required consumer-context input is now observed present. Rerunning Testing would only produce new provenance for the same bytes, which the task forbids, and no change that would invalidate the measurement has been observed.","revisionEvidenceRefs":["result://abiogenesis/5614fa7a5006466741aa3ae2aac161973fafe14298f0be53d42112241ad1c89b","result://abiogenesis/b425dc00b52424043757cd6dcfee11a0b48f6a1acf05bc1baa725567d85fe7ac","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/da01e6e0a00103a728d4b7f74614fe7d06e63f1219b6c98648aed11538e4852f"],"revisionReason":"This revises prior judgment 5614fa7a…, which chose Testing next and recorded two gaps: no current execution observation, and assessment/consumer-context.md absent. The first gap is closed by Testing result b425dc00…, where both commands exited 0 with the expected stdout and the test run showed 2 passes 